{'symbol': 'OMC', 'date': '2022-12-02 21:00:00', 'title': 'KETCHUM HONORED WITH 11 ACCOLADES AT PRESTIGIOUS AMEC AWARDS', 'text': "FIRM AND ITS CLIENTS RECOGNIZED FOR OUTSTANDING WORK AND INNOVATION IN DATA, ANALYTICS AND COMMUNICATIONS MEASUREMENT KETCHUM'S KELLEY HEASLIP NAMED YOUNG PROFESSIONAL OF THE YEAR NEW YORK , DEC. 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- LEADING GLOBAL COMMUNICATIONS CONSULTANCY KETCHUM\xa0WAS RECENTLY ACKNOWLEDGED WITH 11 ACCOLADES AT 2022 AMEC AWARDS, WHICH CELEBRATES EXCEPTIONAL WORK ROOTED IN RESEARCH, INSIGHTS AND ANALYTICS. THIS YEAR MARKED THE 20TH ANNIVERSARY OF THE AWARDS CEREMONY THAT RECOGNIZES REMARKABLE COMMUNICATIONS PROGRAMS SHOWCASING THE IMPORTANCE OF DATA AND MEASUREMENT FROM LEADING AGENCIES AND ORGANIZATIONS AROUND THE WORLD."}